<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 69.4474 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 69.4474 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 69.4474 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.3764 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 27		  Sep 26</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.4474		 69.3764</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	    4.075		   2.555</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
